  "description": "What makes Tributary C Rival GX AXS SUS the ultimate adventure ebike? Start with the carbon frame and our Class 5™ for comfort. Equip it for rugged roads with a suspension fork and 29 x 2.3″ tires. Add rack mounts and ample frame bag space for bringing the necessities (and maybe a few luxuries). Then Charge Your Adventure with a Bosch Performance Line CX drive system and 625Wh battery so you can cover more ground, climb to the scenic viewpoints, and explore the side roads. Top it all off with SRAM’s sweet-shifting Rival/GX AXS drivetrain, and you’ve got an adventure ebike that’s down for any route you can dream up.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
